# The Android app lives in a private repository and is intentionally NOT
# vendored into this public prototype repo.
#
#   git@github.com:TanKhoiTV/kavi-android.git
#
# It was previously registered here as a submodule. It was unregistered so that
# public clones of this repo do not carry a gitlink to a private repository.
# For local Android development, clone that repo alongside this one; its path is
# ignored via `/android` in .gitignore.
